 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Frontier Reasoning on Colab: DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B with vLLM\n",
    "\n",
    "[![Open In Colab](https://colab.research.google.com/assets/colab-badge.svg)](https://colab.research.google.com/github/aswinal22/nanoinfer/blob/main/notebooks/compare_from_scratch_vs_vllm.ipynb)\n",
    "\n",
    "Welcome! In this notebook, we upgrade from the tiny 135M model to a **state-of-the-art 1.5B frontier reasoning model**: **`deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B`** (or **`Qwen/Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct`**).\n",
    "\n",
    "### Why This Model is a Game Changer:\n",
    "1. **Massive Accuracy Leap:** 1.5 billion parameters trained on trillions of tokens—it solves logic puzzles, writes complex code, and reasons step-by-step.\n",
    "2. **Chain-of-Thought Reasoning:** Watch DeepSeek-R1 output its internal `<think> ... </think>` process before answering!\n",
    "3. **T4 GPU Optimized:** Runs at **~50+ tokens/second** on a free Google Colab T4 GPU using `dtype=\"float16\"`.\n",
    "4. **Mobile Ready:** This exact 1.5B model compresses down to **~1.1 GB in 4-bit GGUF**, making it the perfect candidate to host locally on your 8GB Android phone!"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Install & Environment Setup\n",
    "\n",
    "We install `vllm` and configure the environment for Google Colab T4."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "!pip install -q vllm huggingface_hub\n",
    "\n",
    "import os\n",
    "# Ensure stable Colab notebook execution\n",
    "os.environ[\"VLLM_USE_V1\"] = \"0\"\n",
    "\n",
    "import time\n",
    "import torch\n",
    "from vllm import LLM, SamplingParams\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"[Setup] PyTorch Version: {torch.__version__}\")\n",
    "if torch.cuda.is_available():\n",
    "    print(f\"[Setup] GPU Detected: {torch.cuda.get_device_name(0)}\")\n",
    "    print(f\"[Setup] Total VRAM: {torch.cuda.get_device_properties(0).total_memory / 1e9:.2f} GB\")\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print(\"[Warning] No GPU detected. Please go to Runtime -> Change runtime type -> T4 GPU!\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Initialize the vLLM Engine (DeepSeek-R1-Distill 1.5B)\n",
    "\n",
    "We configure vLLM specifically for the Colab T4 GPU:\n",
    "- `dtype=\"float16\"` (T4 has native FP16 tensor cores)\n",
    "- `gpu_memory_utilization=0.7` (allocates 70% of VRAM to PagedAttention, avoiding memory collision)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "MODEL_ID = \"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B\"\n",
    "# Note: You can also switch to \"Qwen/Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct\" anytime!\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"[Engine] Initializing vLLM with {MODEL_ID}...\")\n",
    "t_init_start = time.time()\n",
    "\n",
    "llm = LLM(\n",
    "    model=MODEL_ID,\n",
    "    dtype=\"float16\",               # Mandatory for NVIDIA T4 (Compute 7.5)\n",
    "    gpu_memory_utilization=0.70,   # Pre-allocates ~10 GB VRAM for PagedAttention\n",
    "    enforce_eager=True             # Fast initialization without warmup\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f\"[Engine] Successfully booted in {time.time() - t_init_start:.2f} seconds!\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 3. Test High-Accuracy Reasoning: The Classic Logic Puzzles\n",
    "\n",
    "Let's test DeepSeek-R1 on questions that break smaller models:\n",
    "1. **The Bat and Ball Problem** (Cognitive Reflection Test)\n",
    "2. **The Strawberry Letter Count** (Spatial / Spelling Reasoning)\n",
    "3. **Python Code Architecture** (Writing a clean LRU Cache)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "prompts = [\n",
    "    \"A bat and a ball cost $1.10 in total. The bat costs $1.00 more than the ball. How much does the ball cost? Think step by step.\",\n",
    "    \"How many times does the letter 'r' appear in the word 'strawberry'? Explain your reasoning.\",\n",
    "    \"Explain what happens when an LLM's KV cache runs out of memory in a serving engine like vLLM.\"\n",
    "]\n",
    "\n",
    "# Set sampling parameters\n",
    "# Notice: We set max_tokens=1024 because reasoning models need room to write their <think> trace!\n",
    "sampling_params = SamplingParams(\n",
    "    temperature=0.6,\n",
    "    top_p=0.95,\n",
    "    max_tokens=512\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "for i, p in enumerate(prompts, 1):\n",
    "    print(\"=\" * 80)\n",
    "    print(f\"TEST CASE {i}:\")\n",
    "    print(f\"Prompt: {p}\")\n",
    "    print(\"-\" * 80)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    t0 = time.time()\n",
    "    outputs = llm.generate([p], sampling_params)\n",
    "    elapsed = time.time() - t0\n",
    "    \n",
    "    result = outputs[0].outputs[0]\n",
    "    num_tokens = len(result.token_ids)\n",
    "    throughput = num_tokens / elapsed\n",
    "    \n",
    "    print(result.text.strip())\n",
    "    print(\"-\" * 80)\n",
    "    print(f\"[Performance] Generated {num_tokens} tokens in {elapsed:.2f}s ({throughput:.1f} tokens/sec)\")\n",
    "    print(\"=\" * 80 + \"\\n\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Mobile Deployment Blueprint (Android Preparation)\n",
    "\n",
    "Now that we verified this model's high accuracy, how do we run it locally on an **8GB RAM Android phone**?\n",
    "\n",
    "### The Math for Mobile:\n",
    "- In FP16 on GPU: Model takes **$\approx 3.0\\text{ GB}$**.\n",
    "- In 4-bit Quantization (**Q4_K_M GGUF**): Model compresses down to **$\approx 1.1\\text{ GB}$**!\n",
    "- On an 8GB Android phone, using 1.1 GB of RAM leaves over 6 GB free for the operating system and apps.\n",
    "\n",
    "We can directly download the pre-quantized GGUF binary from Hugging Face for our mobile deployment!"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "print(\"[Mobile Roadmap] For Android Deployment:\")\n",
    "print(\"1. The Quantized Weight URL:\")\n",
    "print(\"   HuggingFace: 'bartowski/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B-GGUF'\")\n",
    "print(\"   File: 'DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B-Q4_K_M.gguf' (~1.12 GB)\")\n",
    "print(\"\\n2. The Mobile Execution Engine:\")\n",
    "print(\"   llama.cpp compiled on Termux (Android ARM64 CPU with NEON vectorization).\")\n",
    "print(\"\\n3. The Mobile API Server Command:\")\n",
    "print(\"   ./llama-server -m DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B-Q4_K_M.gguf --port 8080 --host 0.0.0.0\")"
   ]
  }
